  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty of nature with this customizable Tree of Life bedding set from Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this quilt set offers lightweight warmth in summer and cozy comfort in winter, making it an ideal choice for both indoor bedroom decor and outdoor adventures like camping or picnics.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Every aspect of this quilt can be customized from the background, the framing color, and the text saying squares, allowing you to add names of loved ones or pets.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made with a breathable 100% soft polyester outer fabric and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, year-round comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes one quilt with the option to select your desired quantity of matching pillowcases to complete your bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable, quick-drying, and designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling for low-maintenance durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multipurpose design makes it perfect as a bed quilt, a picnic mat, a throw blanket, or a thoughtful seasonal gift for family and friends.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Yggdrasil, Flowers, Tree</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
